1
00:00:00,569 --> 00:00:03,714
A new report shows inflation swallowed Americans'

2
00:00:03,794 --> 00:00:05,085
income gains.

3
00:00:05,587 --> 00:00:09,001
The Bureau of Economic Analysis said Wednesday that

4
00:00:09,108 --> 00:00:11,943
after-tax income rose in August.

5
00:00:12,143 --> 00:00:13,540
Prices rose too,

6
00:00:13,702 --> 00:00:15,589
leaving buying power flat.

7
00:00:15,838 --> 00:00:19,037
Annual inflation was three point four percent,

8
00:00:19,225 --> 00:00:21,452
above the Fed's two percent goal.

9
00:00:21,954 --> 00:00:23,029
The next test:

10
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:25,786
can income start outpacing prices?

11
00:00:25,986 --> 00:00:29,012
That's what gives households more room to breathe.
